Description: command-line GPIO pinout for the Raspberry Pi Pico
 A beautiful GPIO pinout and pin function guide for the Raspberry Pi Pico,
 Pico W, Pico 2 and Pico 2 W.
 .
 Shows the 40-pin header with SPI, I2C, UART, PWM and HSTX functions, the
 pins wired to onboard hardware, and the underside test pads. Labels can be
 filtered by interface and searched with a regular expression.
